493
01:03:08,242 --> 01:03:16,242
笑い合う分だけ 零れる涙さえも ほら輝かせ
Even the tears that spill just from laughing together, look, make them shine.

494
01:03:16,342 --> 01:03:22,242
明日へ運ぶから 君の隣で
Because I'll carry them toward tomorrow, by your side.

495
01:03:22,442 --> 01:03:31,242
僕たちは世界を越えて行く 迎えに行くよ まだ見えない明日も
We will cross the world, we'll go greet even the tomorrow we can't see yet.

496
01:03:34,142 --> 01:03:40,142
煌めきに変えて きっと僕たちが未来へと 連れて行くから
Turning it into sparkle, surely because we will lead you into the future.

497
01:03:50,742 --> 01:03:56,042
背伸びしては手を伸ばす 憧れの
Stretching up and reaching out to our longing,

498
01:03:56,242 --> 01:04:01,042
行き先示す星になろう
let's become the star that shows our destination.

499
01:04:01,242 --> 01:04:11,042
つまずくその度に 手を差し伸べ合えたら すぐに届くはずさ
Every time we stumble, if we reach out our hands to each other, we should be able to reach it soon.

500
01:04:11,242 --> 01:04:21,242
そっと踏み出した小さな勇気が もう消えないように繋ごう
Gently stepping forward, let's connect so that our small courage won't fade away.

501
01:04:22,242 --> 01:04:31,742
不安も愛しさも 大切に抱きしめて 共に行くよ 目を合わせて
Embracing both anxiety and tenderness preciously, we'll go together, meeting each other's eyes.

502
01:04:32,242 --> 01:04:37,242
晴れわたる希望へ 飛び出せるよ
Toward the clear hope, we can leap out.

503
01:04:37,442 --> 01:04:48,242
突き抜けていく 僕たちの透き通る決意は まだまだ止められないよ
Breaking through, our transparent determination still cannot be stopped.

504
01:04:48,742 --> 01:04:58,242
歩き足りない今日こそ トキメキに変えて もっと僕たちがいつまでも
Turning today, which wasn't enough walking, into excitement, even more so forever

505
01:04:58,442 --> 01:05:03,742
背中を押すから
because we'll push your back.

506
01:05:56,384 --> 01:06:04,384
果て辿り着く 少しずつ 芽生える大好きを紡ぎ
Reaching the end, little by little, weaving the growing love we feel...

507
01:06:05,384 --> 01:06:10,707
どこまでも高く
Reaching high as far as we can go...

508
01:06:11,384 --> 01:06:16,602
明日色の空へ
To the tomorrow-colored sky!

509
01:06:17,384 --> 01:06:21,147
駆け抜けていく 僕たちの青春の光は
Running through, the light of our youth...

510
01:06:21,384 --> 01:06:24,757
誰にも止められないよ！
Cannot be stopped by anyone!

511
01:06:32,380 --> 01:06:36,707
笑い合う分だけ 優しく 零れる涙さえ
Even the tears that spill gently as much as we laugh together,

512
01:06:37,380 --> 01:06:41,707
今 ほら 輝かせ 明日へ運ぶから
Now, look, making them shine as we carry them to tomorrow!

513
01:06:42,057 --> 01:06:50,757
君の隣へ 僕たちは世界を超えていく 迎えに行くよ
By your side, we'll cross the world and go to welcome you!

514
01:06:51,380 --> 01:06:57,707
まだ見えない明日も きらめきに変えて きっと
Turning even an unseen tomorrow into sparkle, surely...

515
01:06:58,380 --> 01:07:07,707
僕たちが未来へと 果てしない未来へと 連れていくから
We will lead you toward the future, toward an endless future!

516
01:07:13,380 --> 01:07:25,257
[Text: We're together FURR-EVER!! It's all thanks to hololive]

517
01:07:28,257 --> 01:08:24,569
[Text: Thank you for 3 Years!! BAU BAU It's because of you that we can shine so bright! The diary of memories we've made together, and even some tears that we've cried too... It's been lots of challenges, but it's all been worth it! As long as we're together, we know that we can do the impossible! Thank you for being our precious Ruffians, here by our side! We'll continue to protect your smiles forever and ever! BAU BAU]

